}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"将素材中的数字放入UI-图标数值中\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"树木森林中前15个元素是城市rpg地图素材\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-05-26 20.47.36.png: /Users/vincet/Desktop/截屏2026-05-26 20.47.36.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\n城市rpg分类中这两个素材是森林树木\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"将该项目所有代码同步到git\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"修改进入游戏后的页面UI；地图外部的顶部增加UI：地图编辑器；选择地图（下拉可选择其他地图）：页面UI底部增加角色状态HP，背包\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"chrome浏览器打开平台\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-05-27 10.42.06.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_R2Q8Em/截屏2026-05-27 10.42.06.png\n\n## 截屏2026-05-27 10.42.13.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_NzOeVB/截屏2026-05-27 10.42.13.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\n游戏页面banner和按钮需要用文字现在是乱码\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #2]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"浏览器chrome打开\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"分析素材中有生命的属性以及可以动的的素材有哪些分类，文字总结\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"