ontent":[{"type":"input_text","text":"所有怪物和敌人都是白天全局视野，夜晚局部视野\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"部分怪物攻击动画不应该是变成白色\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"去掉所有攻击变白的怪物的动画\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"编辑器平台链接\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"为什么游戏会卡顿\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"1.只保留素材库中的素材，不再all resources，2敌人寻路不要每帧算，改成每 0.3-0.5 秒 更新一次。\n3白天全局视野可以保留，但只“发现目标”全局，寻路仍分批执行。\n4夜晚遮罩改成 shader 或低频刷新，不要每帧逐行重画。\n5限制同屏敌人数量，比如最多 8-12 个。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"运行并测试游戏检查为何多怪物出现后开始卡顿\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"优化新发现的独立问题\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"编辑器链接\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"根据当前版本，检查所有代码，找出问题点\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"先修性能问题\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"优化完成后实际测试多敌人是否会卡顿；如果有卡顿继续全局分析代码，优化问题后再进行实测；直到实际测试出多敌人互动状态没有任何卡顿\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"夜晚视野圆的刷新频率提升到不卡顿\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"世界地图被有地图的部分变为绿色，没有游戏地图的方块变为浅紫色\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"游戏编辑器链接\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-06-01 19.26.11.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_4yzDgj/截屏2026-06-01 19.26.11.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\n颜色没有变化\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"设计5位npc的能力；比如生产药水，攻击等；文案讨论\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"根据设计的npc对话内容设计核心能力\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"noah能力是夜间角色有更大的圆形视野以及提示怪物数量的预警；文文的能力是召唤一个守卫，守卫能够激光攻击怪物。lina能力是每5秒在身边生产一个随机的药水瓶道具；米拉的能力有冰冻法术能力，冰冻法术具备伤害值；thorn能力是消耗角色2个木材和2个石头，建造一个防御塔，防御塔可以进行弓箭攻击。在素材中挑选合适的守卫素材；和防御塔素材。完成代码添加到npc中\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"调用imagen生成怪物守卫的png，32*16，素材图，包含守卫攻击动作图；调用imagen生成像素弓箭防御塔，32*16.并加入素材库中\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"平台链接\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"简要总结npc能力\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-06-01 22.17.14.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_Mamfna/截屏2026-06-01 22.17.14.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\nwenwen名字修改为lily；lina 每5秒给所有npc恢复10点hp；thron搭建的防御塔素材没显示；lily召唤的守卫为截图，守卫素材在素材库中；采用该素材；守卫攻击时绿色激光攻击附近敌人；\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Thorn每10秒建造一个防御塔；游戏中thorn没有完成建造\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"确认thorn搭建出的塔可以显示，并调用弓箭箭矢素材进行攻击\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"\n# Files mentioned by the user:\n\n## 截屏2026-06-01 22.46.18.png: /var/folders/nd/fkt5ppxs6635vd7rfflhlc7c0000gn/T/TemporaryItems/NSIRD_screencaptureui_K0G8mR/截屏2026-06-01 22.46.18.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\n采用素材中的塔素材和弓箭素材\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detai