nster/NPC scale checks, destructible-object planning, inventory/drop HUD validation, and late May 31 to June 1 many-enemy performance/debug validation beside character-art staging.\n296:## Task 4: use the local `GameGmeta 地图编辑器` as a manual QA surface for `lost`, `1v1`, and `2v2`, then re-enter the exported runtime to inspect the actual map layout\n306:- GameGmeta 地图编辑器, 127.0.0.1:8794/web/index.html, /exports/web/index.html?map-editor, 32 x 20, 32px 网格, lost, 1v1, 2v2, tiny-town, 城市RPG地图, 地形, 植物-树木森林, 人物-玩家NPC, 宝箱, 怪物敌人, tile 0056, tile 0029, tile 0023, tile 0003, tile 0218, tile 0095, tile 0265, tile 0373, BATTLE, HP, Bag\n353:- extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-05-31T06-10-00-kevI-10min-memory-summary.md (cwd=/Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame, rollout_path=extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-05-31T06-10-00-kevI-10min-memory-summary.md, updated_at=2026-05-31T06:10:00, thread_id=None, chronicle synthetic summary showing `forest edge ambush`, `marked_chest`, `outpost_defense`, and the map-editor/runtime split)\n358:- cloud-fade-3s-20260530, metaai, farm, Map Editor, Press E: Talk to Mira, storyStage, threat, trust, resource, enemyPressure, portalInstability, npcSurvival, reputation, eventBias, eventMemory, forest edge ambush, marked_chest, outpost_defense, 3004 assets, 15 packs, 32 x 20, 32px 网格\n414:- when using AI/event-system ideation in `metaai`, the visible workflow kept the live `farm` runtime and `GameGmeta 地图编辑器` open beside the notes -> keep abstract event/state proposals anchored to the actual local preview instead of letting them drift into detached design prose [Task 8]\n424:- The May 27 manual-QA lane preserved a repeatable editor/runtime proof path: open `GameGmeta 地图编辑器` on `127.0.0.1:8794/web/index.html`, edit a saved map such as `1v1` or `2v2`, watch the status strip for placements/replacements and exported counts like `299 upper-layer assets`, then re-enter `/exports/web/index.html?map-editor...` to inspect the live battlefield without the g