cified exclusions: \"Exclude auth.json, cache, plugin/runtime/sqlite/generated-image/temp directories, and nested .git metadata\" -> build an explicit file list and sanity-check that those paths are absent before archiving [Task 1][Task 2]\n636:- when reporting backup completion, the user asked to \"commit and push to origin main if there are changes\" and report whether push succeeded -> always surface the commit hash, archive checksum, file count, and real remote push result instead of stopping at local verification [Task 1][Task 2]\n646:- The later successful push run is also concrete: `codex-account-memory-20260518-202740`, `file_count=576`, `part_count=8`, verified archive hash `e0fa949619603343edb6ba701d4420593268eafe64eaf5dc9c8e70d323de1ec1`, final commit `e5c8278a904eb5142385e8a925a56554fe6704b4`, and repo state `## main...origin/main` after push [Task 2]\n648:- The repo can already start a backup run `ahead 1`; a successful later push may therefore upload multiple pending backup commits, not just the latest archive refresh [Task 2]\n653:- Symptom: the new backup is locally verified and committed, but the sync still is not done. Cause: `git push origin main` failed with `HTTP 408`, `send-pack: unexpected disconnect while reading sideband packet`, and later `Could not resolve host: github.com`. Fix: treat the run as partial until remote checks succeed and `git status --short --branch` no longer shows `main...origin/main [ahead 1]` [Task 1]\n656:- Symptom: `git push origin main` looks hung during a large split-archive upload. Cause: GitHub can stay silent for a long time while still accepting the push, and `GH001` warnings about 89 MB parts do not necessarily mean failure. Fix: wait for explicit failure/success text, then decide whether smaller split sizes or Git LFS are needed if warning-free pushes matter [Task 2]\n658:- Symptom: sensitive or bulky runtime content leaks into the archive. Cause: relying on broad directory inclusion instead of an explicit allowlist. Fix: rebuild the file list around the known include contract and verify that `auth.json`, `cache`, `sqlite`, `tmp`, generated-image dirs, and nested `.git` are absent before packing [Task 1][Task 2]\n"}}
